Thermion and Google Filament (3D renderer, statically linked)
=============================================================

Use in PocketWorld: the community-feed 3D viewer and the camera-feed
background plane. Thermion is a Dart/Flutter wrapper around Google Filament;
its build hook downloads prebuilt Filament static libraries and links them
into thermion_dart.framework, which ships inside the app. Measured on the
iOS arm64 device build: thermion_dart.framework is 7,598,928 bytes and
carries 5,394 Filament symbols (filament::backend, filament::gltfio,
filament::ibl, filament::geometry, filament::FEngine, ...).

The upstream Filament binary archive ships no license files, so none of the
texts below arrive automatically with the build. They are vendored here and
shipped as Flutter assets from assets/licenses/.

