Swift package layer
===================

swift-crypto (and its transitive dependency swift-asn1)
Source: https://github.com/apple/swift-crypto
License: Apache-2.0 (Copyright (c) 2019-2025 Apple Inc. and the
SwiftCrypto / SwiftASN1 project authors)
Status: not linked into any current build. Verified 2026-09-23 —
ios/Flutter/ephemeral/Packages/FlutterGeneratedPluginSwiftPackage/Package.swift
declares an empty `dependencies: []`, build/ios/SourcePackages/workspace-state.json
resolves no packages, and the name appears nowhere in the iOS or macOS
projects or in any source file. This entry is retained rather than deleted so
that the removal is a deliberate decision and not a silent one; it should be
dropped once someone confirms the dependency is gone for good. No license
text is bundled for it, because nothing it covers is distributed.

